  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government takes policy measures to improve workplace compliance in line with ILS in agreement with social partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will address occupational hazards, diseases and mortality in the mining sector in Kazakhstan, through targeted capacity development, policy advice and knowledge sharing. It builds on ongoing Government&#x2019;s initiatives to strengthen social protection for workers in hazardous jobs as well as on ILO support to address compliance gaps in relation to the Freedom of Association and Protection of the Right to Organise Convention, 1948 (No. 87) and the Right to Organise and Collective Bargaining Convention, 1949 (No. 98).</narrative>
  </description>
